0xD58D2C;0x009CEDC8;00 00 00 00;@42†BT13 Cataclysm Chaos†@40†Yeah, things could get tricky if it rains.†@41†Patricia
0xD50618;0x009CEE68;00 00 00 00;@42†BT07 Beast King Burst Advance†@40†Wings aren't just for flying.†It is.†@41†Patricia
0xD64360;0x009CEF00;00 00 00 00;@42†G-BT03 Sovereign Dragon Star†@40†Because we're cats, after all. They say we're unpredictable.†@41†Patricia
0xD576A0;0x009CEF78;00 00 00 00;@42†BT12 Black Ring Shackles†@40†That child is a sorrowful puppet. With frozen eyes.†Slash the enemy.†@41†Patricia
0xD53294;0x009CF060;00 00 00 00;@42†BT09 Dragon Knight Clash†@40†After the Shinigami leaves, I come forth.†The words remain.†@41†Patricia
0xD57A7C;0x009CF150;00 00;@42†BT12 Black Ring Shackles†@40†Those who become heroes are endowed with heroic signs†Exist.†@41†Patricia
0xD44450;0x009CF218;00 00 00 00;@42†TD07 Descendant of the Sea King†@40†And then, the battle speeds up.†@41†Patricia
0xD69AEC;0x009CF2B0;00 00 00 00;@42†EB07 Mystic Prophet†@40†Circling magic continues to rise. The cycle is terrifying.†Become a fierce weapon.†@41†Patricia
0xD62688;0x009CF3B0;00 00 00 00;@42†G-BT02 Windflower Sky Ascend†@40†The girls bring vitality to the plants.†@41†Patricia
0xD6F550;0x009CF458;00 00 00 00;@42†FC02 Fighters Collection†2014†@40†Escape without delay. Move now.†@41†Patricia
0xD6D608;0x009CF4E4;00 00;@42†G-EB01 Cosmic Roar†@40†Run through the battlefield and decide, Flash Glow Goal!†@41†Patricia
0xD5DAF8;0x009CF5B0;00 00 00 00;@42†BT16 Dragon Sword Dual Combat†@40†The important thing is power, power.†@41†Patricia
0xD43A90;0x009CF634;00 00 00 00;@42†TD04 Cherry Blossom Maiden Priestess†@40†Thank you~♪†@41†Patricia
0xD491B4;0x009CF6A4;00 00;@42†BT01 Knight King's Arrival†@40†Thank you~♪†@41†Patricia
0xD6BB38;0x009CF708;00 00;@42†EB10 Songstress's Duet†@40†Gah~, that's scary, I might eat you~♪†@41†Patricia
0xD6BB6C;0x009CF7A4;00 00;@42†EB10 Songstress's Duet†@40†Gao~ Gao-gao, I ate it~♪†@41†Patricia
0xD68BB0;0x009CF834;00 00;@42†EB05 Divine Vanguards†@40†Thanks for the meal~♪†@41†Patricia
