0xDA2B20;0x00A50EAC;00 00;"By purchasing a pack, you can obtain various cards.†You can use it.†At Card Capital 2nd Store, in addition to packs,†You've purchased trial deck(s), sleeves, and recipe(s).†You can do it.†First, I received the reward from the fight earlier.†Use ""VP"" to purchase your favorite pack.†Let's see!"
