0xDA2B50;0x00A511EC;00 00;"A place to build a special deck that appeared in an anime†You can include cards from different clans in your main deck.†You can place it in there.††【ロイヤルパラディン】†The Royal Paladin deck includes†Blaster・Keep up to 4 ""Dark"" cards†You can insert it.††【リンクジョーカー】†The deck includes Link Joker.†Cards with the letter ""Я"" in their names, feel free to use them.†You can insert the number of cards."
0xDA2B44;0x00A51430;00 00 00 00;"In Cardfight!! Vanguard, choose one clan and†Deck (Main) consisting solely of cards from a clan†I build my deck and G Deck.†Again, according to the Fighter's Rules†""Additional rules for card usage"" apply†It will be done."
0xDA2B08;0x00A51584;00 00 00 00;Quests are indicated by icons on the map.†Selecting this will allow you to place an order.†To check the quest, press the X button.†And the list will be displayed.
0xDA2B2C;0x00A516A8;00 00;Gather cards using various methods to build your deck.†Let's make them stronger and stronger!†Collected cards that exceed the holding limit become CP.†will be converted.
0xDA2B8C;0x00A517C4;00 00 00 00;In this game, follow the Fighter Rules.†Clash Clusters, or Extreme Fight†You can perform a battle.†In World Fight, the clan fight regulations apply.†Fights are conducted in turns.†Local communication battles and friend battles are†Which is it, Clan Fight or Extreme Fight?†You can choose to activate it.†Fights other than Communication Battles are Extri†In Vanguard regulations, fight†It takes place.
0xDA2B5C;0x00A519E8;00 00;Extreme Fight involves multiple clans mixed together.†You can now build your deck.†You can build a deck using just one clan.†End turn.†Fight scenes in the story are extreme.†Fights take place here.
